DESCRIPTION:Based in New York\, where she started comedy\, Natalie Cuomo is
  an international touring stand-up comedian whose debut album ’Shut Up Yo
 u Loved It’ released at #1on the iTunes Comedy Charts. In 2023\, Natalie 
 was named one of New York Comedy Festival’s ‘Comics to Watch\,’ and w
 as named a finalist in the festival’s ’New York’s Funniest Competitio
 n’ the following year in 2024.She has been featured in New York Magazine\
 , LA Times \,Time Out NY\, and Inked Magazine to name a few\, and was featu
 red in Season 16 of ‘Ink Master: No More Ink!’ on Paramount +.Natalie h
 as amassed over 2.4m followers\, and 100mviews\, across social media where 
 she actively engages with her audience and brings them behind the scenes in
 to her everyday life. On Twitch Natalie has built a community of comedy lov
 ers and gamers which has led to partnership opportunities with Amazon Gamin
 g\, Mejuri Jewelry\, Monster Energy Drink\, and more. Natalie can be seen p
 erforming regularly in the heart of New York City\, touring the country\, a
 nd is getting ready to announce her 2026 Headlining European Tour with Live
  Nation.\n\n- Parking is FREE - Click here for a parking guide to the area.
